{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本神奈川縣三車相撞，最少14人受傷送院，其中一人失去意識。</p><p></p><p>事發在神奈川縣藤澤市當地周一上午九時許。警方接報稱，藤澤市一個路口有巴士、的士和一輛私家車相撞。當地傳媒報道，涉車的私家車由一名長者駕駛，途中失控擦撞多輛汽車，再直衝十字路口撞上巴士。警方正在調查事故起因。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.CRASH-1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mzI8x9gQJJ1792383494.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:19:54.546797+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T06:17:47.163198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:17:39.646963+00:00","content_hash":"1d6bf87a36d78eb1d408ad4df163e9d775cf3ac0cecfacf416d6765bc3c389c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}